<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{statusCode}} · {{@site.title}}</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@600&family=IBM+Plex+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;600&display=swap">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{asset "css/screen.css"}}">
</head>
<body class="error-template">
  <header class="site-header shell">
    <a class="site-brand" href="{{@site.url}}/">{{@site.title}}</a>
  </header>
  <main class="site-main">
    <section class="error-page shell">
      <p class="error-code">{{statusCode}}</p>
      <h1 class="error-title">문제가 발생했습니다</h1>
      <p class="error-text">잠시 후 다시 시도해 주세요.</p>
      <div class="error-actions">
        <a class="button button--primary" href="{{@site.url}}/">글 목록으로</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
